<title>USA: McDermott stake held by Soros group.</title>
<headline>McDermott stake held by Soros group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by U.S. investor George Soros said Thursday it holds a 6.79 percent stake in McDermott International Inc or 3,728,900 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought its stake between February 14 and March 12 at prices ranging from $20.587 to $22.678 per share.</p>
<p>McDermott International, based in New Orleans, builds power generation systems for utilities and offshore structures for the oil industry.</p>
